 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "Affine space",
 "statement": "For a scheme $S$ and an integer $n\\geq0$, the *affine $n$-space*\nover $S$ is\n\n$$\n\\mathbf A^n_S=\\operatorname{Spec}\\bigl(\\mathcal O_S[x_1,\\dots,x_n]\\bigr)\n$$\n\nwith its structure morphism $\\mathbf A^n_S\\to S$; for $n=0$ one has\n$\\mathbf A^0_S=S$. The smoothness of the projection is\nthe corresponding statement below.",
 "source": {
